## Sunday afternoon

::bg{location="deck" time="afternoon"}
::sfx{sound="goat bells, coming up the path"}
::use{component="enter" who="wren" side="right"}
@wren{emotion="laughing"}: Sunday! Nobody works on Sunday, so I brought the goats to watch you not working.
@narrator: A goat eats the corner of the log before you can stop it. Ines, from the doorway, does not stop it either.
@wren{emotion="fond" when="run.aff.wren >= 3"}: Tonight, then. Save me a spot by the fountain.
@wren{emotion="neutral" when="run.aff.wren < 3"}: See you tonight. Probably. Everybody's there.
::set{run.aff.wren += 1}
